B.a_5=new A.d6("Rainy-Day Fort","Rain taps on the window. We build a fort with chairs and sheets. A lamp glows inside. We read books and eat apple slices. Our cozy fort feels like a tiny home.")
B.a_p=new A.d6("Duck Parade","A mother duck walks by the pond. Six little ducks follow in a line. They step over a stick and around a rock. Then they all splash into the cool water.")
